 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi there, how are you feeling today?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.44,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_08"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Really good, actually.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.33,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is reading on an e-reader as bad as scrolling my phone?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.23,
   "block": "sleep.dlg25",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Usually much better. E-readers with e-ink screens don't glow like phones, and there are no notifications pulling you in.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.95,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg25"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Mine has a backlight though.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.36,
   "block": "sleep.dlg25",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Most have a warm light setting, turn that on and keep the brightness low.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 1.13,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg25"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "So",
   "est_sec": 0.41,
   "gap_before": 1.18,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "sleep.dlg25"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "it's fine then?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 2.64,
   "block": "sleep.dlg25",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Pretty much. The main thing is that a book doesn't keep you hooked the way social media does, unless it's a thriller.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 1.53,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg25"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "It is a thriller.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.37,
   "block": "sleep.dlg25",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then maybe stop at the end of a chapter, not the middle of a cliffhanger.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.94,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg25"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Right, next thing. My cat keeps scratching the couch. It's shredded on one side.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 1.18,
   "block": "pets.ctx2",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Poor couch. Does she have a scratching post?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.61,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "pets.ctx2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "A little one, she ignores it.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 2.34,
   "block": "pets.ctx2",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then try either a tall sturdy post right by the couch, or a flat cardboard scratcher. Which do you think she'd like?",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.34,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "pets.ctx2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Let me mull it over for seven seconds. Then ask me again.",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 1.05,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "think_time",
   "wait_sec": 7,
   "phrasing": "think_instr_13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "No worries.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.3,
   "role": "ack",
   "phrasing": "ack_14"
  },
